        "original_id": "3df84a8d-9fec-590d-b6e5-1927e91334b1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert John Bardo, Rebecca Schaeffer\n- Topics: murder, stalking, life imprisonment without parole\n\nFacts:\n- Rebecca Schaeffer was an American model and actress who was born on November 6, 1967.\n- Robert John Bardo was born on January 2, 1970.\n- Robert John Bardo stalked American actress Rebecca Schaeffer for three years before killing her on July 18, 1989.\n- Rebecca Schaeffer died on July 18, 1989.\n- Robert John Bardo was convicted in October 1991 for the murder of Rebecca Schaeffer.\n- Robert John Bardo is an American man serving life imprisonment without parole for the murder of Rebecca Schaeffer.",
